OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Wales makes of the Budget:
OL,4,A'It helps, but it's not enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey has set out the
OL,7,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans in
OL,8,Fhis Budget, the first since Andy
OL,9,FBurnham became prime minister. But what
OL,10,Fdo people in Wales think?
OL,12,FOn Wednesday the Budget focused on
OL,13,Feasing household costs, with energy
OL,14,Fbill support, a #100 payment for many
OL,15,Fhouseholds, higher state pensions and
OL,16,Fminimum wages, and changes designed to
OL,17,Fhelp carers and low-income pensioners.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
