OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Wales makes of the Budget:
OL,4,A'It helps, but it's not enough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut while some felt the removal of gas
OL,7,Fstanding charges would make a huge
OL,8,Fdifference, for others the changes are
OL,9,Fnot enough to make a difference to
OL,10,Ftheir lives.
OL,12,FPlaid Cymru, which runs Wales'
OL,13,Fgovernment, said the plans risked the
OL,14,F"kind of spending reductions Wales
OL,15,Fexperienced during the worst years of
OL,16,FTory cuts".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
